// HLSL compute shader sources for runtime compilation
// Note: Don't include this rc file, add 'compute_shaders_game_systems.res' as a link dependency, together with 'pr_hlsl.rc' for the shared includes.
//
// Touch this comment any time an .hlsl/.hlsli file referenced below is edited so MSBuild
// invalidates compute_shaders_game_systems.res — RC dependency tracking does not follow .hlsl edits.
// Touched: 2026-11-04 (atmosphere moved from physics)
src/atmosphere/atmosphere.hlsl TEXT DISCARDABLE "src/atmosphere/atmosphere.hlsl"
